{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26527","headline":"送杨尚书祭西岳 · 姚合","name":"送杨尚书祭西岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报功严祀典，宠诏下明庭。\n酒气飘林岭，香烟入杳冥。\n乐清三奏备，词直百神听。\n衣拂云霞湿，诗通水石灵。\n何因逐驺骑，暂得到岩扃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}